DexSwapModule_EncodeDecodeParams
├── given valid 7-field params
│   └── it should round-trip correctly
├── given zero address target token
│   └── it should round-trip correctly
├── given max address target token
│   └── it should round-trip correctly
├── given encoded length
│   └── it should be 224 bytes (7 ABI words)
├── given oracle config with all fields
│   └── it should round-trip all 7 fields correctly
└── fuzz
    └── it should round-trip any params correctly
